      "cooked": "<p>https://maydaygames.com/card-game-card-sleeves.html</p><p>https://maydaygames.com/card-game-premium-card-sleeves.html</p><p>Either of these work great. I have the cheaper kind, but would love to eventually afford to sleeve all of my cards using the premium. If you do decide to buy in bulk, they have an AMAZING customer service rep who would definitely work some kind of deal out. They give packs away for leaving reviews and stuff like that, so in my opinion they're the best place to get sleeves.</p>",
