      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/killswitch/{size}/2116_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-01-07T21:08:26.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It really only ever happens when I'm shuffling sloppily, or maybe when they're sliding on the table too hard.</p><p>You can easily search through your deck without any trouble, and I've never had issues losing the card inside them completely. They just kind of pop out now and then. I've also gotten used to handling them sleeved, so there's that.</p><p>If you can afford it, definitely go premium. I'll see about finding Ultra Pro equivalents too.</p>",
