      "created_at": "2015-01-07T21:29:44.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm of the opinion that if my cards get enough wear to be unplayable, I'll just buy a new copy of the game. (So far I've only seen minor wear on the black borders and that was easily fixed with a black permanent marker.)</p><p>I figure sleeves are way expensive, and I'd rather give more money to &gt;G than to a sleeve company. But that's just me.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
